# Every text file is checked out with LF line endings on every platform.
#
# Follon hashes checked-in inputs byte for byte: a backtest configuration's
# content hash, a Python strategy bundle's files, and the built-in strategy's
# own source. With the platform's line endings on checkout, one commit
# published different evidence hashes on Windows and on Linux (audit item 75).
# `eol=lf` overrides a local `core.autocrlf`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files are never converted.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
